[{"title":"捕鱼图","author":"张宁","text":"商船竟夕发，莲棹怀晨游。\n劳欢两难久，不及渔家舟。\n三江风月五湖景，妇子相随到白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江天欲雨图为阴佥宪题","author":"张宁","text":"大山昏冥小山黑，万树迷林江变色。\n老龙吸波倦出海，少女驱云未行急。\n白日昼隐西郊阴，欲雨不雨愁人心。\n传岩有客晏犹卧，莫待旱极方为霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画石谷图送吴提学升云南宪使","author":"张宁","text":"石谷山头云昼开，石谷山下泉萦回。\n谷中主人欲高卧，霹雳一声惊梦回。\n六经膏泽已渐被，四方霖雨迟滋培。\n大川舟楫小如苇，惟有图籍江南来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北行别友","author":"张宁","text":"去去青云路，何时更盍簪。\n西风游子恨，落日故人心。\n报国凭三策，论交薄万金。\n寥寥尘境外，诗酒卧东林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄掌教","author":"张宁","text":"泮水官初满，临岐意黯然。\n风云千里道，雨露九重天。\n硕学推程颢，清才数郑虔。\n愿言行莫缓，台阁正求贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张世清爱竹轩","author":"张宁","text":"辞官归故里，种竹已成林。\n扫叶容春笋，编篱护晚阴。\n清风如有意，明月本无心。\n几度临轩坐，烟消綵凤吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘珙弟兄","author":"张宁","text":"不见诸贤久，空悬每日思。\n大兄膺就业，叔子尽能诗。\n岁月嗟长往，功名未有期。\n自怜游泮水，空忆少年时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"领举别武林主人","author":"张宁","text":"别业幽栖处，攀缘及上方。\n地深松叶暗，天近桂花香。\n馆客逢华荐，居人馈玉觞。\n青云从此去，回首意难忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题閒居诗卷","author":"张宁","text":"一廛吾所受，三径旧尝游。\n自有閒中乐，其如物外求。\n烟霞居散地，人事付虚舟。\n见说轩中客，而今好白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿阴清昼堂","author":"张宁","text":"山中有高士，结屋住岩丘。\n树密乌声乱，林深鹤梦幽。\n云来疑向夕，风度欲惊秋。\n何日寻三径，相期避暑游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送安二兼简令兄仁远","author":"张宁","text":"故人不可见，令弟早相知。\n文采京华自，威仪伯仲推。\n云深江树黑，天远雁书迟。\n若问同袍者，悲凉比旧时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄崔惟正","author":"张宁","text":"瘴海风烟息，江关别意长。\n思亲愁未了，忧国意难忘。\n一将城东壁，孤军历异乡。\n功名当此际，慎莫厌风霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐寿为沈秋官作","author":"张宁","text":"世治忧虞外，身閒疾病稀。\n秋风双白鬓，春雨两斑衣。\n结发恩长满，齐眉愿不违。\n同年复同老，鸾凤竟于飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘世经","author":"张宁","text":"一别隔千里，天涯日日心。\n草深兰畹路，云满薜萝阴。\n往事翻成梦，孤怀只自吟。\n相思不相见，情到忽沽襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王给事使满刺加","author":"张宁","text":"圣主重遐荒，天书命夕郎。\n楼船浮瀚海，冠服被蛮方。\n岛屿三韩近，风云八表长。\n兹游未可倦，重译又来王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人冠带还吴中","author":"张宁","text":"自领公车召，十年今始归。\n忽惊文采别，未觉鬓毛非。\n落日迷乌鸟，春风动锦衣。\n慈亲正强健，此乐愿无违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送常州王经府","author":"张宁","text":"三年劳赞府，千里觐长安。\n政为传家熟，清因近俗难。\n烟云江浦别，风雨郡斋寒。\n却爱难兄弟，声华总未阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲","author":"张宁","text":"记得高堂别，俄惊信息稀。\n梦随青草极，目断白云飞。\n晚色应催鬓，新愁欲满衣。\n庭闱有难弟，非是莫忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赤壁图二首 其一","author":"张宁","text":"孤棹临江发，中流晚色开。\n相看今夜月，曾照几人来。\n世事更棋局，浮生落酒杯。\n扣舷清兴发，况是洞箫催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赤壁图二首 其二","author":"张宁","text":"吴魏忽已古，江山遗至今。\n年华互流易，诗酒重登临。\n宦达悲前事，清游契宿心。\n无端孤鹤梦，回首夜沉沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和杨同府閒云晚兴","author":"张宁","text":"本是无心出，归来晚更閒。\n风高防远散，雨小幸时还。\n淡薄秋林外，寒停夕照间。\n同行五色伴，岁尽未还山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘曜卿画","author":"张宁","text":"青山回北里，白水绕西邻。\n世路悲寥落，烟霞爱隐沦。\n柳边垂钓者，花下抱琴人。\n不是怀长往，明时蚤乞身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽刘孟庸","author":"张宁","text":"衣冠归旧族，儒术自皇元。\n落日迷沧海，青山满故园。\n衰麻悲令子，期杖哭遗孙。\n海外诸朋友，伤心入梦魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王子久画","author":"张宁","text":"地域分吴越，河山阅古今。\n江空寒雁下，天远戍城深。\n宦达悲长往，暌违负此心。\n何当随钓叟，归卧北岩阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7311,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"张宁","text":"绿水明遥浦，清峦发曙光。\n舟人迷蜀道，估客望沅湘。\n近渚江蓠熟，盘云晓雁翔。\n悬知登眺日，怀古使心伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7312,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊乐","author":"张宁","text":"未发先期赏，临开不倦游。\n杜陵嗟有泪，彭泽故多愁。\n诗化寒香淡，情甘晚节优。\n宜男空自好，对此共忘忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7313,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴兴前辈","author":"张宁","text":"怀人不可见，名誉重相传。\n诗酒閒居乐，箕裘令子贤。\n莺声茆屋雨，草色暮山烟。\n惆怅天涯路，吟成倍黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7314,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽富太守","author":"张宁","text":"不识荆州面，常闻窦老贤。\n一官成白首，三世共青毡。\n夜月磻溪路，春风杜曲田。\n伤心怀往事，草色自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7315,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张琏下第还大兴","author":"张宁","text":"共是天涯客，那堪复送君。\n感时悲贾谊，下第惜镏蕡。\n沧海沤波远，青山鸟道分。\n声华久自著，聊复叹离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7316,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为姜用贞题梅","author":"张宁","text":"海宇年芳尽，孤标晚更奇。\n不缘风雪里，那见岁寒姿。\n止渴惭无补，调羹已有期。\n逢人如有便，莫负陇头思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7317,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽人母亡","author":"张宁","text":"萱亲不可见，令子竟何依。\n落日啼乌鸟，晨风动綵衣。\n伤心看陇树，清梦引慈闱。\n为问王孙贾，谁应望汝归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7318,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹以安仙桂堂","author":"张宁","text":"华屋临仙境，高标远世尘。\n谁移天上种，为有月中人。\n香和金兰远，阴连玉树新。\n于今堂下景，并入杏园春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7319,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张璆二首 其一","author":"张宁","text":"客里相逢好，临期益惘然。\n归心吴苑月，乡梦楚江烟。\n云水经千里，星河共一天。\n重来应未卜，尘榻为谁悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7320,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张璆二首 其二","author":"张宁","text":"五月都门道，长歌送远归。\n北来青草歇，南望白云飞。\n久病惭余拙，高怀似尔稀。\n江湖旧游事，此别定多违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7321,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"世德堂","author":"张宁","text":"不见高阳里，华堂似太丘。\n九州垂远裔，千载继遗谋。\n婚冠酬嘉会，登歌集胜游。\n犹疑群从夜，星象动高秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7322,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登方洲一笑山","author":"张宁","text":"徙倚出前除，登临极夜初。\n月高墙影尽，风淡树阴疏。\n步缓行堪久，歌阑思有馀。\n瀛洲在天上，吾复爱吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7323,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贫乐窝为王本正作","author":"张宁","text":"陋巷无馀地，破庐常见天。\n往来浑不觉，老去欲忘年。\n世味閒中豁，冥怀澹处便。\n浮云门境外，诗酒只陶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7324,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁寒图","author":"张宁","text":"松竹有晚质，野梅寒共芳。\n秾华看又歇，疏冷故如常。\n庙用期同调，居閒欲并藏。\n相知自相久，非是别炎凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7325,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏竹寄所知","author":"张宁","text":"地僻种元少，年深生渐滋。\n向无当路笋，时有出林枝。\n晚翠迟堪并，春红近亦宜。\n阴森聊自尔，惭负雪霜知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7326,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭刘缓斋","author":"张宁","text":"横涕强吞声，愁怀百倍生。\n一家摧柱石，七县失耆英。\n零落春秋笔，虚微月旦评。\n惟应天上月，清澈似君情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7327,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹鹤老人画为徐时用题","author":"张宁","text":"山水蔼清妍，吴东三月天。\n雨中闻社鼓，树里见炊烟。\n诗景谁家屋，閒情野渡船。\n无人共登泛，斜日下长川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7328,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中偶兴","author":"张宁","text":"晴雪万山深，苍茫晓尚阴。\n泉声来绝涧，寒气积疏林。\n尽道丰年兆，谁同卒岁心。\n灞桥驴背客，诗思正相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7329,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其一","author":"张宁","text":"山色青无际，溪流绿渐深。\n淡烟依远岫，疏雨过平林。\n不见轮蹄迹，惟闻钟磬音。\n何当去城市，来此极招寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7330,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其二","author":"张宁","text":"僧舍烟云表，人家木石中。\n乱山迷远近，流水绕西东。\n犬吠穿萝月，猿鸣落叶风。\n曾逢隐人说，庐阜路相通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7331,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其三","author":"张宁","text":"度壑飞流急，缘溪狭径长。\n松杉围古寺，鸥鹭下回塘。\n旧讶周颙隐，今无贺监狂。\n惟馀林下叟，淳朴似虞唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7332,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其四","author":"张宁","text":"山峻容过鸟，溪深隐钓舟。\n平生不到处，今日偶来游。\n迤逦踰青障，招寻近翠楼。\n桃花流水暮，归路使人愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7333,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其五","author":"张宁","text":"路僻无忙步，林空有远情。\n幽寻行复坐，诗绪乱还清。\n水到荒矶绝，云依野树生。\n何时休世念，来与尔同盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7334,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为杨廷献题画六首 其六","author":"张宁","text":"名郡浙东西，耶溪与霅溪。\n水平吴地落，潮长越山低。\n杨柳藏鸦密，芙蓉隐棹齐。\n何当寻贺监，来往日攀跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7335,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"成化甲辰七夕立秋有作","author":"张宁","text":"立秋逢七夕，不减岁朝春。\n天上佳期协，人间俗事新。\n炎凉俄代序，时节并催人。\n萧瑟梧桐叶，相随野鹊频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7336,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻萧姨讣慰内","author":"张宁","text":"只记生离日，那知死别年。\n素怀常自省，真信托谁传。\n姊妺双成念，夫妻未了缘。\n从今东海月，空照蓟门烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7337,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水竹图","author":"张宁","text":"漠漠孤烟合，盈盈一水深。\n汗青谁涉采，猗菉自行吟。\n野色将秋思，江声并夕阴。\n可怜桃李月，风雨断幽寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7338,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松泉轩","author":"张宁","text":"松叶缘溪密，山泉夹岸流。\n云深常蔽户，石碍仅通舟。\n鹤宿庭中月，厨分涧底秋。\n曾逢轩下客，为说似玄洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7339,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五色牡丹","author":"张宁","text":"五色名皆具，千金价不赊。\n相看真似锦，比美更无花。\n瑞凤衔天诏，祥云夹日华。\n沉香亭久废，变态更谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7340,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽宋举人","author":"张宁","text":"四举皆不偶，一生良苦辛。\n贫无青眼客，死负白头亲。\n牢落愁中事，悲凉梦里身。\n生平清谊在，肠断故交人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7341,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹林七贤","author":"张宁","text":"深竹暗浮烟，群公乐事偏。\n高情动寥廓，清论入微玄。\n岂是巢由侣，何如沮溺贤。\n其谁匡典午，勋烈照遗编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7342,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坡翁雪月二竹 其一","author":"张宁","text":"岁晏暮山深，潇潇雪满林。\n影偏银凤下，声细玉龙吟。\n独抱平生节，谁同末路心。\n惟应松柏树，寒日共萧森。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7343,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坡翁雪月二竹 其二","author":"张宁","text":"明月照幽篁，天空夜气凉。\n繁阴连密地，清影乱疏行。\n雨雪伤迟暮，风烟怯老苍。\n何如今夜景，潇洒胜浮湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7344,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至德清有作","author":"张宁","text":"野树荒烟路，重来十五年。\n溪山如有待，人物故依然。\n渔火明寒浦，菱歌起暮船。\n长桥今夜月，桑梓影重圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7345,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬张篪用来韵","author":"张宁","text":"自废登山屐，长怀漉酒巾。\n风云游子暮，鱼鸟故园春。\n听雨兴思远，临池得句频。\n林泉高致在，词翰近尤新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7346,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次济宁遇雨寄孙廷昭大参","author":"张宁","text":"一自同官后，于今又几年。\n相逢真偶尔，分手各依然。\n旧事凭谁问，新诗觅雁传。\n天涯不可极，烟雨过前川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7347,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草庭","author":"张宁","text":"幽亭何寂阒，芳草不知名。\n花落东风淡，莺啼暮雨晴。\n閒中随意绿，空里过愁生。\n惟有濂溪趣，年年任化成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7348,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆母","author":"张宁","text":"慈母殁七载，痴儿尚一身。\n天涯常有月，堂北更无暾。\n虚室鸡群散，荒园野苧贫。\n平生勤苦事，日远益悲辛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7349,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其一 东湖夜月","author":"张宁","text":"云净水悠悠，空明一色秋。\n夜凉珠泪重，风淡桂香幽。\n放浪袁宏渚，清真庾亮楼。\n其谁泮宫里，登屋候西流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7350,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其二 高阁红梅","author":"张宁","text":"寂阒古城东，犹遗雪后红。\n人无前日兴，花异旧时容。\n远道凭谁寄，新词愧未工。\n绿阴高阁下，零落负春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7351,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其三 天目晓钟","author":"张宁","text":"山闇树冥冥，潮音振海生。\n断依残漏尽，喧杂曙乌鸣。\n远梦惊长乐，迷途想化城。\n如何长往客，犹著夜衣行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其四 市桥官柳","author":"张宁","text":"风暖乳莺啼，春来处处齐。\n晴连官道狭，寒映酒帘低。\n摇落应相待，繁华莫自迷。\n犹胜离别恨，生长灞桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其五 西江晚渡","author":"张宁","text":"天晚路悠悠，归心急暮投。\n水声喧语笑，人影乱浮沤。\n谁击中流楫，犹閒野渡舟。\n济川须及蚤，斜日下沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其六 白塔斜阳","author":"张宁","text":"野色荒凉处，山空日未沉。\n僧归黄叶寺，犬吠白云林。\n塔影凌秋霁，钟声送夕阴。\n无因驻清景，馀兴得幽寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其七 前村牧笛","author":"张宁","text":"沓霭山村静，悠扬草路遥。\n调高初上陇，声近渐临郊。\n落日凝寒岫，悲风动柳条。\n太平民事好，日日换新谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐安八景为尹朴之赋 其八 岷山晴雪","author":"张宁","text":"古澹色常在，苍茫势欲崩。\n阴风吹不尽，寒日照还凝。\n夏迹怀神禹，唐章重少陵。\n丰年欣有象，佳兴会堪乘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":7357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]